      "original_other_voice_preserved": true,
      "source_take": "reading-final-06",
      "spoken_text": "写真を投稿すると、タグ候補が。確認するだけで、次の仲間探しに。"
    },
    {
      "scene": 2,
      "speech_seconds": 8.522375,
      "scene_seconds": 10,
      "trailing_seconds": 1.257624999999999,
      "clipped_samples": 0,
      "peak_dbfs": -6.3138951541248645,
      "sha256": "ed64cf4ef9e33eeb7e94add336e4498a9b8af18e6e64615ba0e563b06a96594e",
      "original_other_voice_preserved": true,
      "source_take": "reading-final-06",
      "spoken_text": "こうは、目的を持つ仲間。同じコミュニティの趣味から、候補を提案。自分で選んで誘えます。"
    },
    {
      "scene": 3,
      "speech_seconds": 7.0860625,
      "scene_seconds": 8,
      "trailing_seconds": 0.6939375000000005,
      "clipped_samples": 0,
      "peak_dbfs": -4.600553215429423,
      "sha256": "81c86dae869540a6fa487a80f6df1dcb76dbed00f3da3ca4570bcf2ac332d590",
      "original_other_voice_preserved": true,
      "source_take": "reading-final-06",
      "spoken_text": "行きたい場所を選んだら、その事業者を講へ招待。承諾されたら、直接やりとり。"
    },
    {
      "scene": 4,
      "speech_seconds": 5.715,
      "scene_seconds": 10,
      "trailing_seconds": 4.0649999999999995,
      "clipped_samples": 0,
      "peak_dbfs": -6.337506336248736,
      "sha256": "96d602bd7450114304a123b6ba0628a89289623203b3b6ab31af8677cbb82f61",
      "original_other_voice_preserved": true,
      "source_take": "reading-final-06",
      "spoken_text": "人数も日程も、行程や見積も。一つの講で相談できます。"
    },
    {
      "scene": 5,
      "speech_seconds": 5.850875,
      "scene_seconds": 7,
      "trailing_seconds": 0.929125,
      "clipped_samples": 0,
      "peak_dbfs": -4.954772164660511,
      "sha256": "5a7dba79d9ff6c633af6284528a2854977e28c614847857d6180b00a7610a468",
      "original_other_voice_preserved": true,
      "source_take": "reading-final-06",
      "spoken_text": "よかった、気になった。同意した専用の振り返りを、選ぶ参考に。"
    },
    {
      "scene": 6,
      "speech_seconds": 7.8759375,
      "scene_seconds": 13,
      "trailing_seconds": 4.904062499999999,
      "clipped_samples": 0,
      "peak_dbfs": -4.84387903015935,
      "sha256": "9a246825fd4ab50b9155f69d784a7f1dabfa57d0c119c370e68e108a2819e723",
      "original_other_voice_preserved": true,
      "source_take": "reading-final-06",
      "spoken_text": "事業者が、何度か通って完成する体験を提案。続ける楽しみを、次の来訪のきっかけに。"
    },
    {
      "scene": 7,
      "speech_seconds": 4.175375,
      "scene_seconds": 5,
      "trailing_seconds": 0.6046250000000004,
      "clipped_samples": 0,
      "peak_dbfs": -4.1372836134127,
